-drenched warm yellow apartment buildings line the left side. On the street level, an outdoor dining area with wooden tables and folding chairs sits in the sun. There are colourful seat pillows in yellows, blues, and reds and the tables are painted with rainbow designs. The building to the right stands in the shade with reflections from the sun bouncing from across the street. At the end of the alley a large, leafy tree stands in the sun and behind it, in the disance, the walls of the Alcazaba fortress can be seen." referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://pxscdn.com/public/m/_v2/787879165920376064/9a26d276d-23d3a8/5XI3Xnfrqevp/BB8YpC1QszwFgu7OhKppI8XpnXIdCPLvQ4y65oNX.jpg"/&gt;</description></item><item><title>雨后双彩虹</title><link>https://pixelfed.social/p/Jess.Stetson/989510075651495908</link><description>&lt;img alt='A bright double rainbow arcs across the sky over Stryd Fawr (High Street), Porthmadog. The secondary rainbow above lies in a darker patch of sky and shows reversed colours from the original rainbow which is has a bright blue sky background. On the right, a cream-colored building with a tiled sign reading "Richard Newell Limited." To the left is a white building with timber framing. Decorative red, white, and green bunting (the colours of the Welsh flag) hangs overhead.' referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://pxscdn.com/public/m/_v2/787879165920376064/9a26d276d-23d3a8/BrXIsg6IFcFP/6iUXoh35q2Q0JemHZpsZC90rrfDyt9bK5BTThlDY.jpg"/&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>